Z||000000||FieroJoe||12-19-2001||10:04 PM||||I just noticed that FieroKid87's topic has now crested 18 pages.  So, I click on the last page and see that all except one of the posts are from him!  I got back to page 17, ALL HIS, go back to 16, all his or his g/f.<P>That is really immature.  Seriously, post padding like that, no class at all.  Sometimes some of these off topic subjects get big like that because people are just going on and on but it is still discussion, not posting smileys.  Setting back the users post count made me smile Cliff!<P>We are all lucky to be here in Cliff's house and that he tolerates the stuff that goes on in here.  Some users should appreciate all that is given to us by Cliff and how much crap he really puts up with.  That topic was just a blatant waste of Cliff's own out of pocket money, since he has to pay for all the extra bandwidth it generated, and CPU time and all that jazz.<P>PFF members are going to respect you if you freqent this board, post good questions and are involved in discussions, and basically show that you want to be a part of this large "family".  You can't expect people to listen to what you say just by having a whole pile of posts.  Quality, not quantity.<P>I am done with my thinking out loud now.  All opinions welcome.<P>Thanks again Cliff!  And I know I speak on behalf of all PFF members to wish you Happy Holidays!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierojoesig2.gif">  <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||13
