Z||000029||Fierokid87||12-20-2001||06:48 PM||||Hey you all want to lay off me here.  So I mad a BIG mistake.  I am in no way immature.  Id say the person who calls someone immature is immature themselves and cant admit it.  But like Cliff said I appolagized.  And i think Cliff should close this thread down too.  Its pointless.  Pointless to yell and scream at a Fellow Fiero owner who at sometime could help you and a Blue Fiero owner at that.  Cant we all get along.  I posted that thread to see if I could hit 1000 where I guess compared to all others im supposed to be at; being on this long(Jan 2001)  But I guess I cant do that.  You (Fierojoe) really know how to make a Fiero owner welcome here.  Now lets forget it and move on.  FieroJoe i have nothing against you.  Ive talked to you on AIM before and you are pretty cool.  All others accept Craig, and Corinne,  I dont know you.  Everyone as far as I could see was having fun in that thread.  Again Cliff closed it and its over.  Drop it.  Cliff my request for you is to also close this thread.  <P>Again Sorry Everyone for any harm that was done.  It takes a real mad to say Im Sorry to everyone and a coward to turn everyone against the party who apologizes.<P>Ill Probably get flame for this but Im just stating what I feel here.<P>Scott<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="red"> Fierokid's  Web site:</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="white">http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero</FONT><P><FONT COLOR="blue">AIM: Fierokid87<BR>ICQ: Fierokid</FONT><P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierokid.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Fierokid87 (edited 12-20-2001).]||||reg||1
