Z||000031||MinnGreenGT||12-20-2001||07:15 PM||||A few points for your consideration.  The first:<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierokid87:<BR><B>Hey you all want to lay off me here... Its pointless.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE></B><P><B>ALL</B> of us here have <B>not</B> been screaming at you... as a matter of fact, I've probably made reference to everything else <B>except</B> your thread.  I started responding in this thread because Cliff asked about creating subcatagories in the post quantity, and I'd really like to know my own breakdown.  That's it.  Simple.  So cool it on the mass-generalizations.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><B>...a Fellow Fiero owner who at sometime could help you and a Blue Fiero owner at that.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Now this one is the reason I'm bothering to write this at all.  All Fiero <B>owners</B> are equal (not all Fieros are equal though).  Please don't try to use the color of your car to make yourself a "minority" or something special.  OK? That's just not right.<P><BR>And finally, I guess I just don't understand this statement.<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><B>I posted that thread to see if I could hit 1000 where I guess compared to all others im supposed to be at; being on this long(Jan 2001)</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Where you're supposed to be at?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fwtf.gif">  First off, why does the amount of time you've been here have anything to do with the number of posts? And how does your number of posts have anything to do with your knowelege of Fieros- or anything else?  I've got nearly 2000 posts and I've been here only 5 months.  That's because I can be online, in the Forum nearly 8 hours a day (because my job allows it).  I know people who have been here longer, know more, and just post less.  It's got nothing to do with anything- other than to show how much you like to talk/participate in discussions.<P>I'm not flaming you.  Just giving you my opinion, and trying to clarify your statements.  OK?  Relax.  This is the Fiero Forum.  Not a life/death situation.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
